                            Lawrence</orgName> <p>This attribution was rejected in the second
                            edition of Medieval Libraries of Great Britain (1964, p. 158), though it
                            was accidentally omitted from the index (1964, p. 336). There were no
                            relevant changes in the Supplement (1987). No corresponding Medieval
                            Libraries of Great Britain index card was found during data
                            reconciliation work in 2026. Compare the entry for this manuscript on
                            the Cambridge University Digital Library: <q>73r: <q>Iacobus Thomas
                            Herison Thys ys ye Abbaye of Rev-</q>, cropped inscription, suggesting
                            the manuscript was perhaps at the Cistercian abbey of Revesby,
                            Lincolnshire, by the 16th century. However, this ownership was rejected
                            by N. R. Ker [in the second edition]</q>.</p></provenance>
